From 926da3c8568e7d1708c5d6a14f3001822fbcbac8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: daveey <daveey@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 11 Oct 2026 23:10:14 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] feat(desktop): a hidden chat's agent keeps driving its own
 Browser page [daveey]

Switching chats parked the session's Browser tab (still mounted) but every
preview.read/preview.act was declined as 'no Hermes Desktop window is showing
this chat', stalling long browser tasks. The window holding the session's
parked page now claims those two requests and acts only in that session's own
off-screen tab - never a pin, never the page on screen. Tours and terminal
reads keep the shown-session rule.
